WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:05.812
Mo and Mandy took off.

2
00:00:05.813 --> 00:00:09.450
But Cora stayed behind the seagrass.

3
00:00:09.451 --> 00:00:13.240
She watched the diver swim closer.

4
00:00:13.241 --> 00:00:17.613
"There's the blue box!" she thought.

5
00:00:17.614 --> 00:00:21.155
The diver was wearing the box around his neck.

6
00:00:21.156 --> 00:00:24.121
He held something in his hand.

7
00:00:24.122 --> 00:00:26.178
Cora gulped.

8
00:00:26.179 --> 00:00:31.404
"The diver has a net!" she thought. Cora

9
00:00:31.405 --> 00:00:35.408
started to zoom away. But—

10
00:00:35.409 --> 00:00:38.292
swoosh!

11
00:00:38.293 --> 00:00:43.167
The diver scooped her into the net!

12
00:00:43.168 --> 00:00:46.683
Mo and Mandy were still swimming away.

13
00:00:46.684 --> 00:00:52.313
Suddenly Mo stopped. "Where's Cora?"

14
00:00:52.314 --> 00:00:58.654
Mandy stopped too. "I don't know."

15
00:00:58.655 --> 00:01:05.131
"We have to go back!" Mo said.

16
00:01:05.132 --> 00:01:08.296
Mo and Mandy swam back to the seagrass.

17
00:01:08.297 --> 00:01:13.480
Mandy gasped. "There's Cora!

18
00:01:13.481 --> 00:01:17.156
She's in the diver's net!"

19
00:01:17.157 --> 00:01:22.961
Mo puffed up. "I'll save you, Cora!"

20
00:01:22.962 --> 00:01:25.647
He rushed at the diver.

21
00:01:25.648 --> 00:01:28.999
But Mo's spikes weren't sharp enough.

22
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.148
The diver had very thick skin! Mo

23
00:01:32.149 --> 00:01:35.318
tried to get away. But

24
00:01:35.319 --> 00:01:41.101
soon he was in the net too. "Help!"

25
00:01:41.102 --> 00:01:46.096
Mo said. "We're trapped!" "No,

26
00:01:46.097 --> 00:01:49.375
we're not!" Cora said. She

27
00:01:49.376 --> 00:01:51.850
tried to bite through the net. Suddenly—

28
00:01:51.851 --> 00:01:53.672
click!

29
00:01:53.673 --> 00:01:59.228
A strange, bright light flashed!

